{"data":{"id":"10.5281/zenodo.23512760","type":"dois","attributes":{"doi":"10.5281/zenodo.23512760","prefix":"10.5281","suffix":"zenodo.23512760","identifiers":[{"identifier":"oai:zenodo.org:23512760","identifierType":"oai"}],"alternateIdentifiers":[{"alternateIdentifierType":"oai","alternateIdentifier":"oai:zenodo.org:23512760"}],"creators":[{"name":"Artamokhov, Aleksandr","nameType":"Personal","givenName":"Aleksandr","familyName":"Artamokhov","nameIdentifiers":[],"affiliation":[]}],"titles":[{"title":"HISTOR snapshot 2026-10-20: MCP tool definitions and how they change"}],"publisher":"Zenodo","container":{},"publicationYear":2026,"subjects":[],"contributors":[],"dates":[{"date":"2026-10-20","dateType":"Issued"}],"language":null,"types":{"ris":"DATA","bibtex":"misc","citeproc":"dataset","schemaOrg":"Dataset","resourceType":"","resourceTypeGeneral":"Dataset"},"relatedIdentifiers":[{"relationType":"IsVersionOf","relatedIdentifier":"10.5281/zenodo.23512759","relatedIdentifierType":"DOI"}],"relatedItems":[],"sizes":[],"formats":[],"version":null,"rightsList":[{"rights":"Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International","rightsUri":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode","schemeUri":"https://spdx.org/licenses/","rightsIdentifier":"cc-by-4.0","rightsIdentifierScheme":"SPDX"}],"descriptions":[{"description":"HISTOR reads the tool list (`tools/list`) of every remote MCP server in the official MCP registryonce a day, and of npm/PyPI MCP packages run in a sandbox once per published version (new versionsfirst, a few hundred a day). It records the exact tool definitions,pins them by digest, and writes a signed label to a public RFC 9162 Merkle log whenever a tool setfirst appears, stays the same, or changes. This snapshot is that record as files.\n\n- **81,879** listed servers (31,040 remote endpoints, 50,839 packages), plus 2,078 delisted- **38,126** with a recorded tool set; **9,340** changed at least once- **23,821** recorded changes, 2026-09-24 to 2026-10-20- **57,846** distinct tool sets (current ones and every one a change replaced)- **636** servers with a block-tier WARDEN pattern match, **14,379** advise-only\n\nLive view and per-server pages: https://histor.modelmarket.dev · code: https://github.com/alexar76/histor\n\nLicense and rights\n\nThe compilation, digests, labels, scans and verdicts are CC-BY-4.0: cite \"HISTOR,https://histor.modelmarket.dev, snapshot 2026-10-20\". Tool names, descriptions and schemas are reproduced as each serverpublished them; their rights stay with their authors. They are included so the definitions can bestudied and checked. A server operator who wants out: open an issue on https://github.com/alexar76/histor with theendpoint or host. Opted-out servers are left out of every later snapshot.","descriptionType":"Abstract"}],"geoLocations":[],"fundingReferences":[],"xml":"","url":"https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.23512760","contentUrl":null,"metadataVersion":0,"schemaVersion":"http://datacite.org/schema/kernel-4","source":"api","isActive":true,"state":"findable","reason":null,"viewCount":0,"viewsOverTime":[],"downloadCount":0,"downloadsOverTime":[],"referenceCount":0,"citationCount":0,"citationsOverTime":[],"partCount":0,"partOfCount":0,"versionCount":0,"versionOfCount":1,"created":"2026-10-20T20:47:36.000Z","registered":"2026-10-20T20:47:36.000Z","published":"2026","updated":"2026-10-20T20:47:36.000Z"},"relationships":{"client":{"data":{"id":"cern.zenodo","type":"clients"}},"provider":{"data":{"id":"cern","type":"providers"}},"media":{"data":{"id":"10.5281/zenodo.23512760","type":"media"}},"references":{"data":[]},"citations":{"data":[]},"parts":{"data":[]},"partOf":{"data":[]},"versions":{"data":[]},"versionOf":{"data":[{"id":"10.5281/zenodo.23512759","type":"dois"}]}}}}